hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1250","Muhammad bin Isa told us, Ibn al-Mubarak told us, and Salam bin Junada told us, Waki` told us all, on the authority of Ibrahim bin Tahman, on the authority of Hussein The teacher, on the authority of Abdullah bin Buraidah, on the authority of Imran bin Husayn, said: I had hemorrhoids, so I asked the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, about prayer. He said: “Pray standing, and if you are not able, then sitting, and if you are not able, then on your side.” In the hadith of Ibn Al-Mubarak, he said: I had hemorrhoids."
